    "optimizedContext": {
      "value": "# Workflow Automation\n## Rules\n- Start lifecycle work from fresh status; follow reconciled blockers, routing, and next action.\n- Structural validation never equals semantic approval; review merged previews for deltas.\n- Verification owns start, scenario/audit evidence, then complete only after success; repeat on fingerprint change.\n- Track and resolve implementation files/links; optimize context when `llmOptimizedContext` enabled.\n## Constraints\n- Never infer fingerprints, recovery targets, or lifecycle validity.\n- Use plural CLI groups and appropriate output formats.",
